OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoner's baby died one day after
OL,4,Abirth - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prisoner's premature baby died in
OL,7,Fhospital a day after he was born by
OL,8,Femergency Caesarean section, an inquest
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FOrion Homer was born at 01:06 on 15
OL,12,FOctober 2023 at Royal Derby Hospital at
OL,13,F34 weeks plus five days gestation and
OL,14,Fdied the following day.
OL,16,FAn inquest at Derby Coroner's Court
OL,17,Fheard his mother Ellen Roberts was a
OL,18,Fprisoner at HMP Foston Hall and was
OL,19,Ftaken to the hospital on 14 October
OL,20,Fafter she raised concerns about reduced
OL,21,Ffoetal movement.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
